        "id": "432c3152",
        "title": "Week 1",
        "tasks": [
          {
            "id": "33eb4710",
            "title": "Never Giving up on Your Dreams | Imran Khan",
            "subtasks": [
              {
                "id": "a891cdd5",
                "title": "INSTRUCTIONS:",
                "link": "https://youtu.be/Xmbs8ihPrlg?si=IfGasC8ZkJUOiqQT",
                "linkLabel": "Watch Here",
                "description": "Apko attached TED Talk/video di gie he. Aap video ko focus se watch karein. Agar pehli baar mein samajh na aaye:\n\nPause → Repeat → Watch Again\n\nJab tak aapko speaker ki main idea samajh na aa jaye.\n\nVideo ko memorize nahi karna. Puri video ka summary bhi nahi dena.\n\nAapko video se sirf ONE lesson choose karna hai aur usay apne words mein 40–60 seconds mein explain karna hai.\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n🎥 40–60 Seconds Video Structure\n\n1️⃣ HOOK — Shuruaat\n\n5–10 seconds\n\nSabse pehle batao ke aap kis cheez ke baare mein baat karne wale ho.\n\nExample:\n\n\"Maine ek video dekhi jisme Never Give Up ke baare mein baat ki gayi, aur is mein ek baat mujhe bohat important lagi.\"\n\n2️⃣ LESSON — Aapne kya seekha?\n\n15–20 seconds\n\nVideo se aapne sirf ek cheez kya seekhi?\n\nExample:\n\n\"Maine ye seekha ke failure ka matlab ye nahi ke humein ruk jana chahiye. Kabhi kabhi failure humein batata hai ke humein apna tareeqa change karne ki zaroorat hai.\"\n\n3️⃣ EXAMPLE — Apni example do\n\n15–20 seconds\n\nAb batao ke ye lesson aapki life, studies, work, designing ya kisi bhi situation mein kaise apply ho sakta hai.\n\nExample:\n\n\"For example, agar mujhe kisi job ke liye select nahi kiya jata, to main quit karne ke bajaye apna portfolio aur communication improve kar sakta hoon aur dobara apply kar sakta hoon.\"\n\n4️⃣ CLOSING THOUGHT — Apni soch\n\n5–10 seconds\n\nEnd mein batao ke is lesson ke baare mein aapki apni kya thinking hai.\n\nExample:\n\n\"Mere liye Never Give Up ka matlab ye nahi ke insan kabhi fail na ho, balkay failure se seekh kar dobara behtar tareeqe se koshish karna hai.\"\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n🧠 Sirf 4 Cheezein Yaad Rakho\nHOOK → LESSON → EXAMPLE → THOUGHT\n\nMain kis cheez ke baare mein baat kar raha hoon?\n↓\nMaine kya seekha?\n↓\nIski meri example kya hai?\n↓\nIske baare mein meri apni soch kya hai?\n\n❌ Ye nahi karna\n\n→ Puri video ka summary nahi dena\n→ Speaker ke exact words copy nahi karne\n→ Script ratta nahi lagani\n→ Mushkil English bolne ki zaroorat nahi\n→ Perfect editing ki zaroorat nahi\n\n\n✅ Ye karna hai\n\nVideo samjho → Ek lesson choose karo → Apne words mein explain karo → Apni example do → Apni thought ke saath finish karo.\n\n\nIf you have any questions, reach out to your dedicated instructor."
              }
            ]
          },
